{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53178","headline":"诗偈 三 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日轮渐渐短，光阴一何促。\n身如水上沫，命似当风烛。\n常须慎四虵，持心舍三毒。\n相见论修道，更莫着婬慾。\n婬慾暂时情，长劫入地狱。\n纵令得出来，异形人不识。\n或时成四足，或是总无足。\n可惜好人身，变作丑头畜。\n今是预报知，行行须努力。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}